  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"15985\" class=\"elementor elementor-15985\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5273ec4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5273ec4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41f70f0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"41f70f0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a02afb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"a02afb9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" src=\"https://mgm-school.nbtksa.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2149220327.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-15981\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70902a8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"70902a8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b409e14 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b409e14\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Investiture Ceremony</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9167be2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9167be2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur school&#8217;s Investiture Ceremony is a time-honoured tradition where student leaders are chosen\nthrough a selective interview process to take on key roles as Head Boy and Head Girl, Deputy Head\nBoy / Head Girl. These student leaders play a vital role in maintaining discipline, leading morning\nassemblies and supporting various school events. By shouldering these responsibilities, they gain\ninvaluable experience and opportunities to develop essential leadership skills. The Investiture\nCeremony, held during a special school assembly, marks the formal handing over of responsibilities\nto these newly elected office bearers, as they embark on their journey to shape the school&#8217;s future.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c5efd4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8c5efd4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b641e3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8b641e3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ce8580 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5ce8580\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Amma School</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab1756f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ab1756f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAmma School was established with the noble aim of empowering parents with the knowledge and\nskills to raise confident and resilient children. In today&#8217;s fast-paced world, children face numerous\nchallenges that require guidance and support. Through Amma School, we strive to create awareness\namong parents about the various issues adolescents encounter and provide them with practical\nstrategies to nurture their children into responsible citizens. Our awareness classes are expertly\nconducted by renowned social workers, psychiatrists, doctors and other specialists. The Amma\nSchool program is held every second Saturday and was inaugurated by Sri. Udit Chaithanya, marking\nthe beginning of a journey to foster positive change in our community\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de87e14 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"de87e14\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecb3707 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ecb3707\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://mgm-school.nbtksa.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/8845.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-15987\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-984007f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"984007f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d376c2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3d376c2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1530629 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1530629\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ae2d3f4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ae2d3f4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6665bde elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"6665bde\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-star\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tConvocation Day\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA grand ceremony held annually in the first week of April to mark an important milestone in our\nstudents' academic journey.\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0782896 elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"0782896\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-star\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFresher’s Day\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA vibrant celebration to welcome and integrate new students, making their transition to our school a\nmemorable experience.\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b0e589e elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"b0e589e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-star\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tToppers’ Day\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA celebration to honor and recognize the academic excellence of students who top the AISSCE,\nAISSE and other internal and external exams, with certificates presented to the high achievers.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f8d5e1 elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"4f8d5e1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-star\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMGM Expo\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAn annual exhibition that empowers students to unleash their hidden talents and showcase their\ninnovative ideas.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c6cccea elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"c6cccea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-star\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tArts Festival\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tOur Arts Festival is a vibrant 4-day celebration, typically held in August, where students showcase\ntheir artistic talents across various disciplines. \t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cded973 elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"cded973\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-star\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAnnual Day\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tOur Annual Day is a grand celebration of student talent, creativity, and achievement. Held annually,\ntypically in January.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-77cbfc1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"77cbfc1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1637d15 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1637d15\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa4cd42 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"aa4cd42\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Sports Day</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-258884f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"258884f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur Annual Sports Day is a celebration of teamwork, sportsmanship and healthy competition. It&#8217;s a\nplatform for our students to showcase their talents, build confidence and develop essential life skills.\nBy participating in various sports and games, our students learn to overcome challenges, work\ntogether and strive for excellence.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2a806c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a2a806c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0b993e1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0b993e1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"474\" src=\"https://mgm-school.nbtksa.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/547.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-15988\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
